This repository incorporates third-party fonts (e.g., Be Vietnam Pro) and other materials that remain the property of their respective owners and are governed by their own licenses (such as the SIL Open Font License). Those materials are not covered by this License. Their licenses and required notices are recorded alongside the files themselves, and those terms prevail over this License for those materials only.

